:: OC Miller Help Lemonade Squeeze [nobr]

After an onslaught of customers, things finally begin to slow down as you are able to sit down and relax a moment until you feel something padding your back. Turning around, you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> holding a couple of lemons in his hands.<br>
<br>

